# Ingestion pipeline scratch data (scraped HTML, intermediate JSON) - reproducible by re-running
# tools/ingestion/*.py; the actual deliverable is app/src/main/assets/content/*.json, which is
# tracked normally. Keeping these out of git avoids ~38MB of regenerable intermediate data.
tools/ingestion/raw/
tools/ingestion/output/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

.tmp_gtaf_collection/
scratch/
*.pem
db/corpus_data/
release_v3.0.0/
keys/
PROFILE_README.md

